00:06:21.859 --> 00:06:24.620
I couldn't believe all the luxury services there were for the homeless.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:26.461
This place had live music,

00:06:27.501 --> 00:06:28.001
snooker,

00:06:28.721 --> 00:06:29.462
martial arts,

00:06:30.522 --> 00:06:32.423
and let's not forget the therapeutic hot tub.

00:06:33.083 --> 00:06:35.644
The mineral-rich hydrotherapy relaxed my muscles.

00:06:41.876 --> 00:06:42.376
Alright,

00:06:42.476 --> 00:06:43.337
enough fooling around,

00:06:43.457 --> 00:06:44.118
I'm starving.

00:06:44.398 --> 00:06:45.058
And lucky for me,

00:06:45.478 --> 00:06:46.639
December is Christmas time,

00:06:46.759 --> 00:06:48.701
and all the charities are loaded with good food.

00:06:49.101 --> 00:06:50.402
When I finally found the place,

00:06:50.702 --> 00:06:51.743
on my first night's menu,

00:06:52.163 --> 00:06:52.663
turkey,

00:06:52.923 --> 00:06:53.423
gravy,

00:06:53.724 --> 00:06:54.665
mashed potatoes,

00:06:55.065 --> 00:06:55.605
corn,

00:06:56.086 --> 00:06:56.706
all washed down.

00:06:56.806 --> 00:06:59.088
