00:06:59.828 --> 00:07:00.328
Next,

00:07:00.328 --> 00:07:01.570
I had to find somewhere to sleep.

00:07:02.269 --> 00:07:03.051
I asked around,

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:03.791
and Matt,

00:07:03.791 --> 00:07:04.452
a homeless guy,

00:07:04.511 --> 00:07:05.052
