00:07:26.762 --> 00:07:27.302
Beautiful.

00:07:28.469 --> 00:07:29.530
Can't go wrong when you're homeless.

00:07:33.372 --> 00:07:34.072
well,

00:07:34.124 --> 00:07:34.853
