00:07:34.864 --> 00:07:40.336
There you go.

00:07:41.406 --> 00:07:42.167
Quality treatment.

00:07:42.737 --> 00:07:43.498
I'm never going home.

00:07:57.996 --> 00:07:59.037
So at the end of day one,

00:07:59.157 --> 00:08:00.398
